(8914, 'frFR', 'An Earnest Proposition', 'Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Beaststalker''s Bindings to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.', 'Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you''ve seen and done much in this world.  Yet I''m willing to wager you haven''t seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I''ll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI''m in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I''ll perform the exchange.', '', '', '', '', '', 'Retournez voir Mokvar à Orgrimmar.'),
(8915, 'frFR', 'An Earnest Proposition', 'Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Magister''s Bindings to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.\n', 'Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you''ve seen and done much in this world.  Yet I''m willing to wager you haven''t seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I''ll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI''m in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I''ll perform the exchange.', '', '', '', '', '', 'Retournez voir Mokvar à Orgrimmar.'),
(8916, 'frFR', 'An Earnest Proposition', 'Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Devout Bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.\n', 'Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you''ve seen and done much in this world.  Yet I''m willing to wager you haven''t seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I''ll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI''m in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I''ll perform the exchange.\n', '', '', '', '', '', 'Retournez voir Mokvar à Orgrimmar.'),
(8918, 'frFR', 'An Earnest Proposition', 'Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Bindings of Elements to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.\n', 'Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you''ve seen and done much in this world.  Yet I''m willing to wager you haven''t seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I''ll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI''m in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I''ll perform the exchange.', '', '', '', '', '', 'Retournez voir Mokvar à Orgrimmar.'),
